## Slack Recommendation Format

3 sentences max, one paragraph. Background + signal + recommendation.

```
*New applicant: {Name}*
{Company} -> {School}, {role}, {years} experience. {Key signal or red flag}.

{emoji} *Recommendation:* {Archive/Dig deeper/Outreach} — {one-line reason}.

Reply :+1: to {action}, or tell me to dig deeper.
cc <@SLACK_USER_ID from user.md>
```
